## CQ-NM-01 | the title screen can show "Stience!"
@group client
@commands open the client; F3+T or restart to the title screen until `Stience!` shows (about 1 in 200), or check the loaded resource: `grep -c "^Stience!$" kubejs/assets/minecraft/texts/splashes.txt` and no resource reload error for `texts/splashes.txt` in latest.log
@pass `Stience!` is the file's last line and appears as a splash; other splashes still show
@fails the KubeJS resource pack not loaded on the client, or the file saved with a byte order mark
@draft random splash; a runner checks the file and the log, the owner sees it on the title screen
